 {"id":"ra10175", "sources":["ra10175","disini"], "aliases":["ra 10175", "republic act 10175", "cybercrime prevention act", "batas cybercrime", "10175"], "text":{
  "en":["What is Republic Act No. 10175?", "RA 10175 is the Cybercrime Prevention Act of 2012. It addresses specified offenses involving computer systems and data, computer-related fraud and identity theft, and certain content-related acts. Its application must take account of court rulings and other applicable laws. Describe your concern if you want help organizing possible next steps."],
  "tl":["Ano ang Republic Act No. 10175?", "Ang RA 10175 ay ang Cybercrime Prevention Act of 2012. Saklaw nito ang mga tinukoy na paglabag sa computer at datos, panloloko at pagnanakaw ng pagkakakilanlan gamit ang computer, at ilang gawaing may kaugnayan sa nilalaman. Dapat isaalang-alang ang mga pasya ng hukuman at iba pang batas sa paglalapat nito."],
  "taglish":["Ano ang RA 10175 o Cybercrime Prevention Act?", "Ang RA 10175 ay Cybercrime Prevention Act of 2012. Saklaw nito ang specified computer at data offenses, computer-related fraud at identity theft, at certain content-related acts. Kailangan ding i-consider ang court rulings at other applicable laws. I-describe ang concern mo para sa general next-step guidance."]}},
